data-entity-uuid=\"b5efb30e-6690-43b1-8444-a31c40da4fd7\" filename=\"ESEA - B9 ML Guardian Outreach - 6.15.2026_0.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20B9%20ML%20Guardian%20Outreach%20-%206.15.2026_0.pdf\" title=\"ESEA - B9 ML Guardian Outreach - 6.15.2026_0.pdf\">Multilingual Parent/Guardian Outreach</a> (Title III)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(B11) <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"b31267f6-1a51-404a-8059-094b153eb04d\" filename=\"ESEA - B11 Timely Family Communication - 6.11.2026_0.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20B11%20Timely%20Family%20Communication%20-%206.11.2026_0.pdf\" title=\"ESEA - B11 Timely Family Communication - 6.11.2026_0.pdf\">Timely Family Communication</a> (Title I, Part A)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(B12) <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"678043a8-a305-4922-8bfb-74404e0cd632\" filename=\"ESEA - B12 Title I School-Parent Compact - 6.8.2026_0.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20B12%20Title%20I%20School-Parent%20Compact%20-%206.8.2026_0.pdf\" title=\"ESEA - B12 Title I School-Parent Compact - 6.8.2026_0.pdf\">School-Parent Compact </a>(Title I, Part A)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(C1) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20C1%20Class%20Size%20Reduction%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Class Size Reduction</a> (Title II, Part A)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(C2) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20C2%20Collaboration%20of%20Professional%20Development%20Planning%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Collaboration of Professional Development Planning</a> (Title II, Part A)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(D1) <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"80d21080-a34f-47f0-a808-0c2d33a08ff3\" filename=\"ESEA - D1 Timely and Meaningful Non-Public Consultation - 6.15.2026_0.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20D1%20Timely%20and%20Meaningful%20Non-Public%20Consultation%20-%206.15.2026_0.pdf\" title=\"ESEA - D1 Timely and Meaningful Non-Public Consultation - 6.15.2026_0.pdf\">Timely and Meaningful Non-Public Consultation</a> (ESEA Equitable Services)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(E1) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20E1%20Detailed%20Accounting%20Records%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Detailed Accounting Records</a> (ESEA Fiscal)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(E2) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20E2%20Travel%20Policy%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Travel Policy</a> (ESEA Fiscal)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(E4) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20E4%20Time%20and%20Effort%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Time and Effort</a> (ESEA Fiscal)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(E5) <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"b581c35f-ba5d-4857-802c-2ee0f3017040\" filename=\"ESEA - E5 Non-Public Procurement &amp; Payment Process - 6.15.2026_0.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20E5%20Non-Public%20Procurement%20%26%20Payment%20Process%20-%206.15.2026_0.pdf\" title=\"ESEA - E5 Non-Public Procurement &amp; Payment Process - 6.15.2026_0.pdf \">Non-Public Procurement and Payment Process</a> (ESEA Fiscal)&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(E7) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20E7%20Written%20Procurement%20Standards%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Written Procurement Standards</a> (ESEA Fiscal)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(E8) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20E8%20Supplement%20Not%20Supplant%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Title IA Supplement, Not Supplant</a> (Title I, Part A)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">&nbsp;(S1) <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"f37bd8cf-8292-4b5c-8da6-ec8f3e5e5107\" filename=\"ESEA - S1 ATSI School Improvement Plan - 7.15.26.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20S1%20ATSI%20School%20Improvement%20Plan%20-%207.15.26.pdf\">ATSI School Improvement Plans</a>&nbsp;(Title IA, Section 1003)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(S2) <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"15dd4016-6f65-455d-808e-e404c5cad42d\" filename=\"ESEA - S2 TSI School Improvement Plan - 7.15.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20S2%20TSI%20School%20Improvement%20Plan%20-%207.15.2026.pdf\">TSI School Improvement Plans</a>&nbsp;(Title IA, Section 1003)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(S3) <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"c77ec345-61fa-4efe-a7c7-17232da20160\" filename=\"ESEA - S3 CSI School Improvement Plan - 7.15.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20S3%20CSI%20School%20Improvement%20Plan%20-%207.15.2026.pdf\">CSI School Improvement Plans</a>&nbsp;(Title IA, Section 1003)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>High Items</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(A2) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20A2%20TAS%20Program%20Implementation%20Requirements%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">TAS Program Implementation Requirements</a> (Title I, Part A)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(A6) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20A6%20Schoolwide%20Plan%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Updated Schoolwide Plan</a> (Title I, Part A)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(B6) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20B6%20Parent%20and%20Family%20Feedback%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Parent and Family Feedback</a> (Title I, Part A)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(B7) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20B7%20Parental%20Notification%20of%20Academic%20Progress%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Parental Notification of Academic Progress</a> (Title I, Part A)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(B8) <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"cebf2682-2e60-448f-ac7a-c161fe3055d4\" filename=\"ESEA - B8 Guardian Notification of ML Students - 6.15.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20B8%20Guardian%20Notification%20of%20ML%20Students%20-%206.15.2026.pdf\" title=\"ESEA - B8 Guardian Notification of ML Students - 6.15.2026.pdf\">Parent Notification of Multilingual Status</a> (Title III)&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(B10) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20B10%20Title%20I%20School%20Level%20Parent%20Involvement%20Policy%20and%20Activities%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">School Level Parent Involvement Policy</a> (Title I, Part A)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(C3) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20C3%20Statutorilly-Defined%20Professional%20Development%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Statutorily-Defined Professional Development</a>&nbsp;(Title II)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(C4) <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"0c466277-4a98-41da-a11c-6075b2cb1800\" filename=\"ESEA - C4 Title III Effective Professional Development - 6.15.2026_0.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20C4%20Title%20III%20Effective%20Professional%20Development%20-%206.15.2026_0.pdf\" title=\"ESEA - C4 Title III Effective Professional Development - 6.15.2026_0.pdf \">Multilingual Effective Professional Development</a> (Title III)&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(E3) <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"d45bc8b9-a7d2-4c72-a0cf-330695573a46\" filename=\"ESEA - E3 Procurement Standards (Conflict of Interest) - 6.15.2026_0.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20E3%20Procurement%20Standards%20%28Conflict%20of%20Interest%29%20-%206.15.2026_0.pdf\" title=\"ESEA - E3 Procurement Standards (Conflict of Interest) - 6.15.2026_0.pdf\">Procurement Standards</a> (ESEA Fiscal)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">(E6) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20E6%20Equipment%20Policy%20and%20Procedures%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Equipment Policy and Procedures</a> (ESEA Fiscal)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-eyebrow\">ESEA Federal Programs</p>\n<p class=\"doe-lead\">The Maine Department of Education (DOE), as the State Education Agency (SEA), is responsible for the oversight and monitoring of programs and activities carried out under the Elementary and Secondary Education Act (ESEA), as amended by the Every Student Succeeds Act (ESSA).</p>\n<nav class=\"doe-toc\"><h3>On this page</h3><ol><li><a href=\"#esea-federal-programs-monitoring\">ESEA Federal Programs Monitoring</a></li><li><a href=\"#monitoring-submission-window\">Monitoring Submission Window</a></li><li><a href=\"#monitoring-fact-sheets\">Monitoring Fact Sheets</a></li></ol></nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"esea-federal-programs-monitoring\">\r\n<h2>ESEA Federal Programs Monitoring</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>The General Education Provisions Act (GEPA) requires that each state \"adopt and use proper methods of administering each applicable program, including monitoring of agencies, institutions, and organizations responsible for carrying out each program.\"</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Monitoring procedures must be designed to promote each subrecipient's progress in achieving program goals and objectives; adherence to laws, regulations, and assurances governing the program; and conformity to the approved application, performance reports, or other relevant documents. Likewise, the <a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-2/subtitle-A/chapter-II/part-200?toc=1\">Code of Federal Regulations</a> requires the SEA to monitor grants to ensure compliance with applicable Federal requirements and that performance goals are achieved.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Maine DOE has adopted a consolidated approach to monitoring State Administrative Units (SAUs), both to ensure compliance with federal laws and to support the effective implementation of local programs. The following programs are included within consolidated ESEA program monitoring: Title I, Part A; Title I, Part D; Title II, Part A; Title III, Part A; Title IV, Part A; and Title V, Part B, Subpart II.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Guidance &amp; Training</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20FY27%20ESEA%20Federal%20Programs%20Monitoring%20Guidance%20-%209.16.2027.pdf\">ESEA Federal Programs Monitoring Guidance</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20FY26%20ESEA%20Federal%20Programs%20Monitoring%20Training%20-%2010.22.2025.pdf\">ESEA Federal Programs Monitoring Training</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WJQDSn1mbyM\">ESEA Monitoring Video Training</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-item list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=unMNDuqbwfk\">Monitoring Instrument Training</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span> Video tutorial of Grants4ME</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"monitoring-submission-window\">\r\n<h2>Monitoring Submission Window</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>To enhance the effectiveness in supporting a continuous improvement cycle, the ESEA Federal Programs Team has adopted a monitoring plan that includes additional monitoring items for SAUs with a Medium or High monitoring level. SAUs at these monitoring levels will have additional requirements to be completed. The Submission, Review, Results, and Corrective Action timelines are outlined as follows:</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\" width=\"100%\">\r\n\t<thead>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">Action</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">Timeline</th>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</thead>\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>SAU Notification Sent</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>September 14</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Monitoring Training and Collection Window Opens<br />\r\n\t\t\t<em>SAUs with a Medium or High monitoring level are strongly encouraged to attend.</em></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>October 6</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>SAU Submission Deadline</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>November 24</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>ESEA Feedback Provided to SAUs</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>January 8</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Notification of Onsite Visits</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>January 18</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>On-site Visits</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>March or April</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Corrective Action Requirements Finalized</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>April 16</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Close Out</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>May 30</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"monitoring-fact-sheets\">\r\n<h2>Monitoring Fact Sheets</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-8 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Medium Items</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(A1) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20A1%20Prioritizing%20High-Need%20Schools%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Prioritizing High-Need School(s)</a> (ESEA)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(A3) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20A3%20Transition%20Strategies%20Title%20ID%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Transition Strategies</a> (Title I, Part D)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(A4) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20A4%20Evaluation%20of%20Progress%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Evaluation of Progress</a> (Title I, Part D)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(A5) &nbsp;<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20A5%20ML%20Identification%20and%20Exit%20Procedures%20-%206.15.2026_0.pdf\" title=\"ESEA - A5 ML Identification and Exit Procedures - 6.15.2026_0.pdf\">Multilingual Learner Identification and Exit Procedures</a> (Title III)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(A7) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20A7%20Curricular%20Alignment%20Title%20I%20Part%20D%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Curricular Alignment</a> (Title I, Part D)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(A8) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20A8%20Student%20Supports%20-%20Title%20III%20Family%20Engagement_0.pdf\" title=\"ESEA - A8 Student Supports - Title III Family Engagement_0.pdf\">Multilingual Family Engagement</a> (Title III)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(B1) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-fi