e I, Part A)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">&nbsp;(S1) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20S1%20ATSI%20School%20Improvement%20Plan%20-%207.15.26.pdf\">ATSI School Improvement Plans</a>&nbsp;(Title IA, Section 1003)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(S2) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20S2%20TSI%20School%20Improvement%20Plan%20-%207.15.2026.pdf\">TSI School Improvement Plans</a>&nbsp;(Title IA, Section 1003)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(S3) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20S3%20CSI%20School%20Improvement%20Plan%20-%207.15.2026.pdf\">CSI School Improvement Plans</a>&nbsp;(Title IA, Section 1003)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>High Items</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(A2) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20A2%20TAS%20Program%20Implementation%20Requirements%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">TAS Program Implementation Requirements</a> (Title I, Part A)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(A6) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20A6%20Schoolwide%20Plan%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Updated Schoolwide Plan</a> (Title I, Part A)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(B6) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20B6%20Parent%20and%20Family%20Feedback%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Parent and Family Feedback</a> (Title I, Part A)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(B7) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20B7%20Parental%20Notification%20of%20Academic%20Progress%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Parental Notification of Academic Progress</a> (Title I, Part A)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(B8) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20B8%20Guardian%20Notification%20of%20ML%20Students%20-%206.15.2026.pdf\" title=\"ESEA - B8 Guardian Notification of ML Students - 6.15.2026.pdf\">Parent Notification of Multilingual Status</a> (Title III)&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(B10) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20B10%20Title%20I%20School%20Level%20Parent%20Involvement%20Policy%20and%20Activities%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">School Level Parent Involvement Policy</a> (Title I, Part A)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(C3) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20C3%20Statutorilly-Defined%20Professional%20Development%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Statutorily-Defined Professional Development</a>&nbsp;(Title II)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(C4) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20C4%20Title%20III%20Effective%20Professional%20Development%20-%206.15.2026_0.pdf\" title=\"ESEA - C4 Title III Effective Professional Development - 6.15.2026_0.pdf \">Multilingual Effective Professional Development</a> (Title III)&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(E3) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20E3%20Procurement%20Standards%20%28Conflict%20of%20Interest%29%20-%206.15.2026_0.pdf\" title=\"ESEA - E3 Procurement Standards (Conflict of Interest) - 6.15.2026_0.pdf\">Procurement Standards</a> (ESEA Fiscal)</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">(E6) <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20E6%20Equipment%20Policy%20and%20Procedures%20-%206.9.2026.pdf\">Equipment Policy and Procedures</a> (ESEA Fiscal)</li>\r\n\t\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":[],"decisions":[{"id":"filechip","on":true,"label":"Tag a document link with the format it opens","why":"1 link on this page opens a file — 1 Video — and says nothing about it, while others in the same list carry a tag because their author typed one. The format is read from the file name, so the list stops being half-labelled. No link text changes.","value":"1 link"},{"id":"balance","on":true,"label":"Give the cards the width their content needs","why":"1 row holds two cards of very different weight in equal halves, and cards in a row are the same height — so the short one is stretched and the difference shows as empty space. 2.3× — 1326 characters beside 577. Only the column widths change.","value":"1 row"},{"id":"itemdash","on":true,"label":"Drop the dash once the link is set apart","why":"1 of those items separate the link from its description with a dash. The link is now set in the display face at a larger size with a chevron after it, so the dash marks a boundary that is already unmistakable. Only the separator is removed — no word changes.","value":"1 separator"},{"id":"items","on":true,"label":"Separate a link from its description","why":"1 list item opens with a link and then explain it, all at the same weight — so the thing you can click is no easier to find than the sentence about it. The link becomes the item and the explanation sits under it.","value":"1 item"},{"id":"deck","on":true,"label":"Use this paragraph as the page description","why":"It is the page’s own opening paragraph, moved into the banner rather than rewritten.","value":"The Maine Department of Education (DOE), as the State Education Agency (SEA), is responsible for the oversight and monitoring of programs and activities carried out under the Elementary and Secondary Education Act (ESEA), as amended by the Every Student Succeeds Act (ESSA)."},{"id":"descap","on":true,"label":"Start a description with a capital","why":"1 description begins with a small letter, because it used to run on from the link after a dash. The dash is gone and the link now sits above in its own face, so each description opens a line of its own. One character changes and only ever the first.","value":"1 description"},{"id":"toc","on":true,"label":"Add a contents list (3 sections)","why":"Built from the section headings already on the page. Below three sections a list is not a route."},{"id":"eyebrow","on":true,"label":"Eyebrow: \"ESEA Federal Programs\"","why":"Taken from the parent page, /learning/esea."}],"mechanical":["white-on-white text: 2","empty paragraphs removed: 1","drupal entity attrs stripped: 56","empty list items removed: 1","loose text wrapped in a paragraph: 19","paragraph inside a table cell unwrapped: 16","row colours handed back to the striping rule: 2","paragraph unwrapped inside a card header: 3","action links marked: 38","space moved out of a link: 1","blockhead heading level normalised to h2: 2"],"findings":[],"safe":true,"audit":{"alias":"/learning/esea/monitoring","title":"ESEA Monitoring","changed":"2026-09-16T15:40:45+00:00","words":629,"bytes":16254,"fixes":["white-on-white text: 2","empty paragraphs removed: 1","drupal entity attrs stripped: 56","empty list items removed: 1","loose text wrapped in a paragraph: 19","paragraph inside a table cell unwrapped: 16","row colours handed back to the striping rule: 2","paragraph unwrapped inside a card header: 3","action links marked: 38","space moved out of a link: 1","blockhead heading level normalised to h2: 2"],"flags":[],"contentSafe":true,"headings":[{"l":2,"t":"ESEA Federal Programs Monitoring","bh":true},{"l":3,"t":"Monitoring Submission Window","bh":true},{"l":3,"t":"Monitoring Fact Sheets","bh":true}],"outline":[],"components":{"cards":9,"cardHeaders":3,"cardTitles":0,"accordions":0,"tables":1,"dataTables":1,"contactCube":0,"jumbotron":0,"dcNote":0,"blockheads":3,"videos":0,"images":0,"buttons":0},"access":{"imagesNoAlt":0,"vagueLinkText":[],"emptyLinks":0,"tablesNoScope":1,"multipleH1":0,"inlineColour":2},"links":{"internal":[],"files":["/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/fil